  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPD frame agreement Efu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Norwegian Petroleum Directorate&apos;s (NPD) deliveries under Energy for Development Program (Efu).
Through the OfD program, Norwegian institutions share experiences and build competence in partner country authorities, who are responsible for managing the petroleum sector in their respective countries. This includes efficient mechanisms for reducing climate gas emissions from petroleum production, i.e. flaring and methane emissions. Competence transfer in this area includes effective rules and regulations on emissions to air, CO2 pricing and taxes, technical solutions to prevent fugitive emissions, infrastructure requirements for handling associated gas, measuring emissions, reporting requirements, data collection and monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
